  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names the killer move sword feather bladewing while facing Qi Sea in immemorial white heaven. Countless sword feathers pierce the heavenly wind qi wall and float down, shrouding the battlefield. The sword feathers form into bright bladewings that rapidly cut everything in their path. Immortal Gu Houses appear extremely fragile in front of these bladewings. Only the rank eight Immortal Gu House Green Cloud Spark Warship resists them. Xia clan’s Immortal Gu House Whale Fishing Boat has its final layer of defense penetrated. Over ten bladewings fly in and start a rampage. Xia Rui Zhi is killed inside the Immortal Gu House.",
      "chapters": [
        2070
      ],
